OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers embrace the great
OL,7,     Foutdoors at Emma and Rich's
OL,8,     FLydcott Glamping in Cornwall.
OL,9,     FEveryone's taken with the
OL,10,     Fspectacular surroundings but less
OL,11,     Fso with their cabins and DIY
OL,12,     Fbreakfast.
OL,13,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FThe B&Bers meet up on payment day
OL,15,     Fto settle their differences.
OL,16,     FThere's plenty of finger pointing,
OL,17,     Fbefore the payments are revealed
OL,18,     Fand the winner announced.
